        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 60 feet makes a ranged or spell attack, or targets an ally with a spell.</p><hr /><p>Instead of sending the effect nowhere, you send the <em>creature</em>. It attempts a Fortitude save against your Cosmo DC; on a critical failure it is teleported one mile away.</p><p>The module moves the token along the line from you to it, as far as the scene allows, and reports the distance actually travelled.</p><hr /><p>Granted by the Aries Zenith Boon only. Once per minute.</p>"
